===============================================================================
Models, weights and datasets
===============================================================================

No model weights, pretrained checkpoints, proprietary datasets or restricted
scientific data are distributed in this repository or in the Python wheel.

The model registry lists several planned engines (AutoDock Vina, OpenMM,
Chemprop, Boltz-2, Chai-1). They are metadata-only entries: their code and
weights are not bundled, and their licenses must be audited separately before
any integration is enabled. A permissive repository license does not
automatically cover model weights or training data.

The example dataset in examples/datasets/demo_library.csv is a small,
hand-assembled set of public drug-like molecules used only to exercise import
and ranking. It is not a curated benchmark and carries no efficacy claims.

